esearch', 'informed decisions']}, {'id': '7', 'content': 'Dietary changes for Agent Dale Cooper were initiated due to digestive issues, leading to a diet of high-quality wet and dry food.', 'source': 'Interview Transcript: Pet Parent Health and Wellness Practices Part 1', 'type': 'fact', 'confidence': 1.0, 'tags': ['diet change', 'digestive issues']}, {'id': '8', 'content': "Audrey's diet includes high-quality dry kibble and healthy treats, with careful calorie counting to prevent weight gain.", 'source': 'Interview Transcript: Pet Parent Health and Wellness Practices Part 1', 'type': 'fact', 'confidence': 1.0, 'tags': ['diet', 'calorie counting']}, {'id': '9', 'content': 'Exercise routines for Agent Dale Cooper and Audrey are tailored to their species, with structured activities and mental stimulation.', 'source': 'Interview Transcript: Pet Parent Health and Wellness Practices Part 1', 'type': 'observation', 'confidence': 0.95, 'tags': ['exercise', 'species-specific routines']}, {'id': '10', 'content': "Veterinary care, including annual wellness exams and preventive measures, is a critical part of Alex Morrison's approach to pet health.", 'source': 'Interview Transcript: Pet Parent Health and Wellness Practices Part 1', 'type': 'fact', 'confidence': 1.0, 'tags': ['veterinary care', 'preventive measures']}, {'id': '11', 'content': 'Alex Morrison keeps detailed health records for both pets, aiding in the early detection of issues and ensuring consistent preventive care.', 'source': 'Interview Transcript: Pet Parent Health and Wellness Practices Part 1', 'type': 'behavior', 'confidence': 0.95, 'tags': ['health records', 'early detection']}, {'id': '12', 'content': 'Alex Morrison maintains relationships with both a regular vet and an emergency vet, ensuring comprehensive care for their pets.', 'source': 'Interview Transcript: Pet Parent Health and Wellness Practices Part 1', 'type': 'behavior', 'confidence': 0.95, 'tags': ['veterinary care', 'emergency preparedness']}]
