ing a deeper commitment to the well-being of pets that considers long-term health, quality of life, and the sustainability of care practices. This insight underscores a shift towards more ethical, sustainable, and informed approaches to pet ownership.', 'pattern_id': 'Strategic Pet Care Decision-Making', 'non_consensus': True, 'first_principles': True, 'impact_score': 0.85, 'supporting_evidence': ['Increasing use of data and technology in pet care planning.', 'Growth in pet care services offering customized care plans.', 'Rising consumer demand for ethically produced pet products.']}], 'design_principles': [{'principle': 'The system should treat pets as integral members of the family, providing comprehensive care solutions that reflect their elevated status.', 'insight_id': 'Pets as Full-Fledged Family Members: A Paradigm Shift', 'action_verbs': ['treat', 'providing', 'reflect'], 'design_direction': 'Family-centric pet care', 'priority': 0.9, 'feasibility': 0.8}, {'principle': 'The experience must integrate preventive care strategies into pet healthcare services, mirroring advancements in human wellness.', 'insight_id': 'Preventive Pet Care: A Reflection of Human Healthcare Evolution', 'action_verbs': ['integrate', 'mirroring'], 'design_direction': 'Preventive healthcare integration', 'priority': 0.8, 'feasibility': 0.7}, {'principle': 'The system should enable informed and responsible pet care decision-making, moving beyond emotional attachment to embrace ethical obligations.', 'insight_id': 'Strategic Pet Care: Beyond Affection, Embracing Responsibility', 'action_verbs': ['enable', 'moving', 'embrace'], 'design_direction': 'Ethical and informed decision-making', 'priority': 0.85, 'feasibility': 0.75}], 'metadata': {'request_id': 'ca46cd09-f2e7-4cf0-bb5b-1110d2bcd9fb', 'framework': 'Hybrid (LangGraph + OpenAI Agentic)', 'model': 'gpt-4-turbo-preview', 'orchestration': 'LangGraph', 'function_calling': 'OpenAI Native', 'research_data_s3_path': 'research_data/aas-1.tx