gs': ['hydration', 'pet care']}, {'id': 'fca46cd09-f2e7-4cf0-bb5b-1110d2bcd9fb-5', 'content': 'Exercise routines for Agent Dale Cooper and Audrey Horne are tailored to their species-specific needs and individual preferences.', 'source': 'Interview Transcript: Pet Parent Health and Wellness Practices Part 1', 'type': 'observation', 'confidence': 0.95, 'tags': ['exercise', 'species-specific needs']}, {'id': 'fca46cd09-f2e7-4cf0-bb5b-1110d2bcd9fb-6', 'content': "Veterinary care, including annual wellness exams and preventive treatments, is a critical component of Alex Morrison's approach to pet health.", 'source': 'Interview Transcript: Pet Parent Health and Wellness Practices Part 1', 'type': 'fact', 'confidence': 0.95, 'tags': ['veterinary care', 'preventive health']}, {'id': 'fca46cd09-f2e7-4cf0-bb5b-1110d2bcd9fb-7', 'content': 'Alex Morrison keeps detailed health records for both pets, aiding in the early detection and treatment of potential health issues.', 'source': 'Interview Transcript: Pet Parent Health and Wellness Practices Part 1', 'type': 'behavior', 'confidence': 0.9, 'tags': ['health records', 'early detection']}, {'id': 'fca46cd09-f2e7-4cf0-bb5b-1110d2bcd9fb-8', 'content': 'Alex Morrison values the role of mental stimulation and environmental enrichment in maintaining the well-being of pets.', 'source': 'Interview Transcript: Pet Parent Health and Wellness Practices Part 1', 'type': 'observation', 'confidence': 0.9, 'tags': ['mental stimulation', 'environmental enrichment']}, {'id': 'fca46cd09-f2e7-4cf0-bb5b-1110d2bcd9fb-9', 'content': "Alex Morrison's approach to pet care involves making informed decisions and balancing the needs of the pets with their lifestyle.", 'source': 'Interview Transcript: Pet Parent Health and Wellness Practices Part 1', 'type': 'behavior', 'confidence': 0.9, 'tags': ['informed decisions', 'lifestyle balance']}, {'id': 'fca46cd09-f2e7-4cf0-bb5b-1110d2bcd9fb-10', 'content': 'Alex Morrison has established relationships with both